WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The referee tablet (right) follows the scoresheet (left): score, serve, line-ups.

2
00:00:09.852 --> 00:00:15.339
"1 REF" / "2 REF" turns the court to the referee's side of the net.

3
00:00:15.389 --> 00:00:22.389
A time-out on the scoresheet: the tablet shows "Recorded by the scorer" with the countdown.

4
00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:31.043
A substitution: the popup names it and the new player appears on the court.

5
00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:40.715
"Scoresheet" shows the live scoresheet, read only.

6
00:00:40.765 --> 00:00:46.231
The tablet's menu: "Keep screen on" so it never turns off.
